      "text": "Frequency once per day\n\nTrigger Akki takes piercing or slashing damage\n\n---\nEffect Akki's blood sprays from the wound, forming a crimson cloud laced with tiny lightning bolts. Adjacent creatures take 1 electricity splash damage, and Akki is Concealed until the end of her next turn.",
